{"id":"wb-6-640","name":"白云寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"白云寺 (辉县市)","text":"白云寺，旧名“白茅寺”，又称“梦觉寺”、“大觉寺”、“白鹿寺”，为中华人民共和国河南省辉县市的一座佛寺，位于薄壁镇东北的白云寺国家森林公园内，地处太行山南麓，现存山门、中佛殿、大雄宝殿等建筑及塔林，还有六株树龄逾千年的银杏树，四雌二雄。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E4%BA%91%E5%AF%BA_(%E8%BE%89%E5%8E%BF%E5%B8%82)","revisionId":94535598,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94535598","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/479e42388e308ff46820e640.jpg","title":"20260825_Huixian_Baiyun_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260825_Huixian_Baiyun_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/20260825_Huixian_Baiyun_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南辉县 白云寺 中佛殿","width":320,"height":213}}